{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id117404450"}, "name":{"label":"Sk27!!!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-17T23:02:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14680386075"}, "title":{"label":"Impressed and like ChatGPT rather than the other AI apps at the moment"}, "content":{"label":"ChatGPT was my first AI application, and my experience has been very positive. I use it for everyday tasks such as writing letters, emails, answering questions, checking spelling, editing photos, and rephrasing text. This has been especially helpful because I have a brain tumour.\n\nIts photo-editing tools are generally excellent, although they sometimes alter my complexion.  However, the limits on photo uploads can be frustrating, particularly when errors reduce my allowance and I have to wait for it to reset. I also believe important information should be checked independently, as ChatGPT can occasionally make mistakes.I also find the brightness and darkening features useful if it changes my complexion too much. ￼\n\nI tried Dola after seeing advertisements on TikTok, but found it unreliable. It often failed to follow instructions, provided accurate ￼ information, shared broken links, and repeatedly apologised without resolving problems. By comparison, ChatGPT is more consistent, clearer about its limitations, and better at adapting to my instructions. The prompts at the bottom of the screen are also helpful because of my neurological difficulties.\n\nOverall, ChatGPT has been a valuable and reliable tool. Despite its limitations, it is the AI application I prefer and would continue to use.\n\nDespite my review being mainly positive, my concern is that I will become reliant to an AI and not be able to do things myself that I was able to do previously as it has made me lazy. Even using it for this review.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
