{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id834227944"}, "name":{"label":"H_5han"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-17T10:30:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14678379618"}, "title":{"label":"Removal of Features paid for"}, "content":{"label":"I’ll simplify this - Do not pay for a subscription thinking what you paid for will stick around. \n\nGPT 5.5 was excellent, warm, personable, and navigated issues excellently and with humour. \nThis model was removed/retired consulting paying users and replaced with a noticeably worse, colder, less humorous imitation in the GPT 6 series. \n\nOpenAI repeatedly makes their product worse and each model iteration becomes more and more difficult to work with. \n\nDo not pay money for this nonsense.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
